      "reason": "ClearTrail Plus is 2,499 INR and ClearTrail Mini is 1,299 INR, meaning the Plus is 1,200 INR more expensive, not less."
    },
    {
      "quote": "An original invoice is unnecessary when claiming the standard India manufacturer warranty for ClearTrail Plus, provided the buyer says the purchase came from an authorized seller.",
      "label": "contradicted",
