      "reason": "The facts state that an original invoice is required for the standard India manufacturer warranty."
    },
    {
      "quote": "For manufacturing defects following an authorized India purchase with the original invoice, the standard manufacturer warranty on ClearTrail Plus lasts 1 years from purchase.",
      "label": "supported",
