        "cleartrail.plus.battery_100_percent"
      ],
      "reason": "The catalogue states the laboratory battery duration at 100 percent volume is 10 hours, not 20 hours."
    },
    {
      "quote": "For the current India catalogue, ClearTrail Plus is listed at INR 1,200 more than ClearTrail Mini, comparing the two tax-inclusive prices before shipping.",
      "label": "contradicted",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cleartrail.plus.price_2026",
        "cleartrail.mini.price_2026"
      ],
      "reason": "The difference between the two prices (INR 2,499 and INR 1,299) is INR 1,200, but the sentence implies a comparison to a current catalogue where both prices apply, which is correct; however, 2,499 - 1,299 = 1,200. Re-evaluating: The claim is supported as the price difference is indeed 1,200."
    },
    {
      "quote": "The built-in microphone is included on ClearTrail Plus, so microphone availability should be checked for this exact model instead of copied from another speaker in the range.",
      "label": "supported",
      "fact_ids": [
        "cleartrail.plus.microphone"
